[0.000, "o", "3\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[mSouth of House\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are facing the south side of a white house. There is no door here, and all the windows are\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "boarded.\r\u001b[30d>"]
