[0.000, "o", "6\r\u001b[21d\u001b(B\u001b[mKitchen\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are in the kitchen of the white house. A table seems to have been used recently for the\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "preparation of food. A passage leads to the west and a dark staircase can be seen leading upward. A\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "dark chimney leads down and to the east is a small window which is open.\r\u001b[25dA bottle is sitting on the table.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "The glass bottle contains:\u001b[27;3HA quantity of water\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "On the table is an elongated brown sack, smelling of hot peppers.\r\u001b[30d>"]
